      "title": "Problems, failure modes and limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "find_one distinguishes no match from an error through Result<Option<T>>: a matching document yields Some, and no match yields None. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/rust/current/crud/query/retrieve.md",
