          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The driver README snapshot warns that dropping unfinished driver futures for cancellation or timeout can leave internal state inconsistent. It recommends polling them to completion and suggests timing out a spawned task’s JoinHandle instead of the driver future directly. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)",
          "source": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo-rust-driver",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:f0bbda2ce0500bee90cd0087b3e51052ca78059b1e6eb1f2fe2311aeaa428bec",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:82b312271d64d363f97d5eaa4b1e7bf8fb290f7bfea202a2055cbe0e2765d362"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Serde skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\" omits a None field when serializing. This is a conditional serialization rule, unlike skip, which suppresses both serialization and deserialization. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://serde.rs/field-attrs.html",
          "note": null,
